EQEmu RoF2 Mercenaries

Production mercenary extension for EQEmu, targeting the May 10, 2013 RoF2 client.
Upstream EQEmu copyright and GPLv3 notices are preserved in LICENSE and source.
Requires the pinned shared infrastructure described in docs/INSTALL.md.
